  "description": "Do-Yun, who moved to a quiet village in the countryside, accidentally found a white fox collapsed on the road and brought it home, naming it Haru. That very night after bringing the fox home, Do-Yun dreams of having relations with a mysterious white-haired man. Startled awake, Do-Yun finds a small child sleeping soundly beside him...\n\n *“Could it be... you're Haru...?”\n\n“Huh?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
